# iSmile Dental Clinic Website - Implementation Plan

## Goal Description
Build a premium, "liquid glass" themed website for iSmile Dental Clinic. The site will be built using React and Vite, focusing on a high-end, modern aesthetic with smooth animations and glassmorphism effects.

